        "title": "Food and wine of Franche-Comté",
        "subtitle": "Jura wines, cheeses and smoked meats from the Haut-Doubs",
        "introduction": "The Haut-Doubs is also something to discover at the table. Its wines come from the vineyards of Franche-Comté, its cheeses from village dairies, its cured meats from the smoke of the great farmhouse chimneys. This page introduces these specialities, their history and the best pairings. When you arrive, a fir syrup from Maison Rième is waiting for you in the apartment, as our gift. The cheeses and cured meats are just a short walk away, in the village shops.",
