        "trouver_intro": "Addresses, opening hours and visits are on our <a href='commerces.html'>Shops</a> and <a href='activites.html'>Activities</a> pages. In short:",
        "trouver_cheese": "<strong>Cheeses</strong>: the Fruitière des Lacs in the village, where you can watch Comté and Morbier being made every morning; the Fromagerie du Mont d'Or in Métabief; the Comté ripening cellars at Fort Saint-Antoine.",
        "trouver_meat": "<strong>Cured meats</strong>: the Boucherie Paillard Frères in the village, which also lets you discover its tuyé.",
